    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάντᾰσ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσμα</span>
			, <i>apparition, phantom,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνύπνια φαντάσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					710
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυκτέρων φ. ἔχουσι μορφάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					312
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. δαίμονος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dio</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				54
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				94
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				390
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
