				2.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				14.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὰ μνήματα . . ὤφθη ἄττα ψυχῶν
					σκιοειδῆ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					81d
				</span></i>
			; <i>vision, dream,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1102b10
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				21.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> pl.,
